# Ledger fragments for work with no pull request.
#
# CHANGELOG.md is generated from merged PR bodies (AGENTS.md 7.1), so a normal
# PR writes nothing here. Scaffold one with tools/changes_new.py only for a
# direct push, an ops diagnosis, or an audit conclusion.
#
# A fragment is a NEW file with a unique name, so two agents can never collide
# on it. changes_collate.py folds it into the ledger and deletes it.
